{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":11,"result_bytes":542,"result_hash":"sha256:7264ea96ce2fa0b76b806e6579794048580f4e0e7e6d934fce83e5978289d338","result_inline":"README.md\nslugify\n\n/private/var/folders/yb/b_617z_s2ml933nmr_k7m47m0000gn/T/saga-bench-3578220652/ts-0015-slugify-api-drift/5/ws/vendor/slugify:\nCHANGELOG.md\nindex.ts\n# docsite-pages\n\nPage model for the documentation site. `pageSlug(title)` turns a page title into the URL segment; slugs are lowercase, hyphen separated and ASCII, and existing URLs must keep resolving.\n\nThird-party code lives under `vendor/` as exact copies of upstream releases (see `vendor/README.md`); `vendor/slugify` was bumped to 2.0.0 last week.\n\nNode 24, `npm test`.","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:3d3f14bbf19bf9be4400c804bc3ef9ad74813ddcbe56fddb0dbd80c1c619a856","mono_ns":12000000,"prev":"sha256:a928b72cafb202c29d3ed87838d659a26eac52a9046fb3d6522b29b0da29b954","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":12,"session":"090aa593-3790-43ab-9572-dd5bbff58da5","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.012Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
